==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|es}}

# {{lb|en|music}} The [[ability]] to identify a [[note]] by name on hearing it, or to [[sing]] a specific note from memory, without the benefit of a [[reference]] [[pitch]].
# {{lb|en|less common}} The exact pitch of a note described by its [[frequency]] in [[vibrations]] per [[second]].

